@startuml
title 15. Ingestion — spatial-loader (batch)
autonumber
actor Operator
participant "Overpass API" as Overpass
participant "spatial-loader" as Loader
database SpatialDB

Operator -> Overpass : query tags over area
Overpass --> Operator : GeoJSON (features with @id)
Operator -> Loader : run --dsn --geojson
Loader -> Loader : parse features
loop per feature (batched)
    Loader -> Loader : derive category from tags\nsplit dedicated cols vs tags JSONB
    Loader -> SpatialDB : upsert location_point ON CONFLICT (osm_id)
end
Loader --> Operator : loaded / skipped counts
note over Loader,SpatialDB : offline, dev + prod, off request path
@enduml
